<https://w3id.org/arknet/model/requirements> {
  <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/943d28d3-95aa-4ee3-b6db-55add7df5dd3> a <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#FunctionalRequirement>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "FR-1";
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Requirement anlegen"@de, "Create a requirement"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Das System muss es einem Coding AI Agent ermöglichen, stellvertretend für einen Requirements Engineer ein neues Requirement — funktional oder nicht-funktional — mit Titel, testbarer Beschreibung und mindestens einem Akzeptanzkriterium anzulegen."@de,
      "The system shall enable a Coding AI Agent, acting on behalf of a Requirements Engineer, to create a new requirement — functional or non-functional — with a title, a testable description and at least one acceptance criterion."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#status> <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#Proposed>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#priority> <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#MustHave>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#acceptanceCriterion> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/07a54881-04ac-43cc-8aa9-c93010e25635>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/2a9a6ba4-68c3-45a5-95e0-4e194b3667c4>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#usesTerm> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/0c5ff58a-96c6-4143-80e2-683586edf6e8>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/e4942ed2-d1f7-4a1e-9322-9c5f323d767d> .
  
  <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/14713dc9-142b-44c4-8415-e8a4bace5408> a <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#FunctionalRequirement>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "FR-2";
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Requirement/Constraint bereitstellen"@de, "Provide a requirement or constraint"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Das System muss es einem Coding AI Agent ermöglichen, ein bekanntes Requirement oder Constraint anhand seines Business-Codes gezielt nachzuschlagen oder alle erfassten Requirements bzw. Constraints aufzulisten."@de,
      "The system shall enable a Coding AI Agent to look up a known requirement or constraint by its business code, or to list every recorded requirement or constraint."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#status> <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#Proposed>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#priority> <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#MustHave>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#acceptanceCriterion> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/42e94d22-f564-47bc-8f36-1745e2bab792>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/ad2fb637-2429-4e9e-87b8-9f63c443f35d>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/b993bde4-51bc-4c15-82bb-3406fdaddfaf>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/3bd69188-4681-42f7-986d-66f6b562c7b9>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#usesTerm> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/0c5ff58a-96c6-4143-80e2-683586edf6e8>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/87ab2eca-efa7-4067-be38-103b0ab6f299>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/db788965-188e-47cc-854d-d03ad8e62eee>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/e4942ed2-d1f7-4a1e-9322-9c5f323d767d>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#rationale> "Ein Aufrufer hat eine Kennung in verschiedenen Formen zur Hand: vollständig, verkürzt oder nur als Business-Code. Je mehr Formen angenommen werden, desto öfter passt eine Form auf mehrere Ressourcen. Der Vertrag rät dann nicht: Mehrdeutigkeit endet in einer Meldung, nie in einer Vermutung, weil eine stillschweigend falsche Ressource erst weit entfernt von ihrer Ursache auffällt. Die bequeme Kurzform bleibt möglich, solange sie eindeutig ist; wächst der Bestand, kann eine Kurzform mehrdeutig werden, die vorher funktionierte."@de,
      "A caller has an identifier at hand in several forms: full, shortened, or as a bare business code. The more forms are accepted, the more often one form matches several resources. The contract then does not guess: ambiguity ends in a message, never in an assumption, because a silently wrong resource surfaces far away from its cause. The convenient short form stays available as long as it is unambiguous; as the store grows, a short form that used to work may become ambiguous."@en .
  
  <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/2a1acada-473e-4a73-9c1f-b54b7b463445> a <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#FunctionalRequirement>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "FR-3";
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Requirement nachträglich ändern"@de, "Amend an existing requirement"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Das System muss es einem Coding AI Agent ermöglichen, stellvertretend für einen Requirements Engineer Titel, Beschreibung, Akzeptanzkriterien und Priorität eines bereits angelegten Requirements zu ändern, ohne dessen Business-Code, Status und die Verknüpfungen zu Terms und Constraints anzutasten."@de,
      "The system shall enable a Coding AI Agent, acting on behalf of a Requirements Engineer, to change the title, description, acceptance criteria and priority of an already created requirement, without touching its business code, its status, or its links to terms and constraints."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#status> <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#Proposed>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#priority> <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#ShouldHave>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#acceptanceCriterion> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/2bb41669-a8aa-4e31-a35c-5d82f1b208e2>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/7d2993ee-407f-46b9-acb5-793018d91d23>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/e87c62bb-888f-4285-b4f4-8f0ed56c5aca>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/92be33ce-54e6-43ee-91aa-d5dc8e788a2e>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/7438a125-e58d-4255-b5be-41e9634f3762>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/230e6780-f48b-4d7b-9025-7b2e6517ac58>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#usesTerm> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/0c5ff58a-96c6-4143-80e2-683586edf6e8>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/87ab2eca-efa7-4067-be38-103b0ab6f299>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/c2df3868-3a66-46ca-8621-677374d02aa6>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/e4942ed2-d1f7-4a1e-9322-9c5f323d767d> .
  
  <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/80601114-b9c2-4c74-8616-a23d586fed75> a <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#FunctionalRequirement>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "FR-4";
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Requirement mit einem Term verknüpfen"@de, "Link a requirement to a term"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Das System muss es einem Coding AI Agent ermöglichen, ein Requirement mit einem Term zu verknüpfen, den sein Text verwendet, damit nachvollziehbar wird, welche Begriffe ein Requirement in Anspruch nimmt."@de,
      "The system shall enable a Coding AI Agent to link a requirement to a term its text uses, so that it becomes traceable which terms a requirement draws on."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#status> <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#Proposed>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#priority> <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#MustHave>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#acceptanceCriterion> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/11c683bd-1c46-4454-808a-9dd61699bcf6>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/97732171-9b4d-43b4-a6cf-3c1da026c891>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/21e19114-510f-4280-b623-7516868dc4a2>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/35d7bea0-bd7d-4c44-be5a-50c3b73e2232>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#usesTerm> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/0c5ff58a-96c6-4143-80e2-683586edf6e8>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/c2df3868-3a66-46ca-8621-677374d02aa6>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/e4942ed2-d1f7-4a1e-9322-9c5f323d767d> .
  
  <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/d9de2fa4-1c52-44a0-868a-ab929db8ae65> a <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#FunctionalRequirement>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "FR-5";
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Requirement-Status setzen"@de, "Set a requirement's status"@en;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Das System muss es einem Coding AI Agent ermöglichen, stellvertretend für einen Requirements Engineer den Status eines Requirements zwischen PROPOSED und ACCEPTED zu wechseln."@de,
      "The system shall enable a Coding AI Agent, acting on behalf of a Requirements Engineer, to switch a requirement's status between PROPOSED and ACCEPTED."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#status> <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#Proposed>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#priority> <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#CouldHave>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#acceptanceCriterion> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/59428f66-c519-4578-a4d7-7bf2c26dfee4>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/06ca63a7-ebab-4fbd-8d1a-3d57cea66d17>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/1841e226-8a2b-4c64-bea6-1ec5b0e01602>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/88a0f279-4256-4d8b-a27d-fe891a36755a>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/b24a6649-66c3-4257-b2d3-9270629104f8>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/87cbfb0b-b176-4e7d-b72e-200b588e24f7>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#usesTerm> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/0c5ff58a-96c6-4143-80e2-683586edf6e8>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/87ab2eca-efa7-4067-be38-103b0ab6f299>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/c2df3868-3a66-46ca-8621-677374d02aa6>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/e4942ed2-d1f7-4a1e-9322-9c5f323d767d>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#rationale> "Der Status ist ein unverbindliches Reifegrad-Signal für den lesenden Menschen, ohne Durchsetzung. Ein durchgesetzter Status verlangte ein Modell davon, was Erfüllung heißt (welche Kanten vorhanden sein müssen, welche Zustände Nachbarn haben dürfen); dieses Modell existiert nicht, und es zu erfinden wäre eine Prozessentscheidung für fremde Teams. Deshalb löst ein Statuswechsel keine Konsequenz aus und ist in beide Richtungen setzbar: eine Einbahnstraße wäre kein Reifegrad-Signal, sondern eine unvollständige Durchsetzung. Sollen später echte Konsequenzen kommen, ist das eine neue Entscheidung, kein Ausbau dieser."@de,
      "The status is a non-binding maturity signal for the human reader, without enforcement. An enforced status would require a model of what fulfilment means (which edges must exist, which states neighbours may have); that model does not exist, and inventing it would be a process decision imposed on other teams. A status change therefore triggers no consequence and can be set in both directions: a one-way street would not be a maturity signal but an incomplete enforcement. If real consequences are wanted later, that is a new decision, not an extension of this one."@en .
}

<https://w3id.org/arknet/model/use-cases> {
  <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/d7f6ea8a-3615-4f04-a32b-4248c15d3728> a <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#UseCase>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "UC1";
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Requirement/Constraint nachschlagen"@de, "Look up a requirement or constraint"@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#useCaseGoal> "Der Coding AI Agent kennt Titel und Beschreibung bzw. Statement eines oder mehrerer Requirements/Constraints, um sie in seiner laufenden Arbeit zu verwenden."@de,
      "The Coding AI Agent knows the title and description or statement of one or more requirements/constraints, to use them in its ongoing work."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#trigger> "Eine andere, außerhalb von arknet liegende Aufgabe des Coding AI Agent (Umsetzung, Review, Rückfrage) macht einen bestimmten oder alle Requirements/Constraints relevant."@de,
      "Another task of the Coding AI Agent outside arknet (implementation, review, follow-up question) makes a specific or all requirements/constraints relevant."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#useCasePostcondition> "Coding AI Agent kennt Titel, Beschreibung bzw. Statement, Status/Priorität (wo vorhanden) sowie die Business-Codes verknüpfter Terms und Constraints der angefragten Ressource(n)."@de,
      "The Coding AI Agent knows the title, description or statement, status/priority (where present), and the business codes of linked terms and constraints of the requested resource(s)."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#mainStep> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/fd37e606-1b45-456b-9c42-770cbeb0748f>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/b33989c0-a709-4a21-a209-1df1b3964b7b>;
    <http://open-services.net/ns/rm#satisfies> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/14713dc9-142b-44c4-8415-e8a4bace5408>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#extensionStep> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/e5016a2c-18a8-49ea-88f3-4fb4a0a6e9f4>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/d82bbe04-02f0-498f-b276-2e87fc5b4aee>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#primaryRole> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/4c4ba9ce-cd98-4f46-b63e-f090460d30ee> .
  
  <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/dfab53b5-4f4f-4629-9756-182ff0f8e659> a <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#UseCase>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "UC2";
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Requirement erfassen"@de, "Record a requirement"@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#useCaseGoal> "Ein neues, testbares Requirement ist im Architekturmodell vorhanden."@de,
      "A new, testable requirement exists in the architecture model."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#trigger> "Der Requirements Engineer erkennt im Gespräch mit dem Coding AI Agent einen Bedarf für eine neue Anforderung."@de,
      "In conversation with the Coding AI Agent, the Requirements Engineer recognizes a need for a new requirement."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#useCasePostcondition> "Ein neues Requirement mit eindeutigem Business-Code existiert im Architekturmodell, verknüpft mit den im Text verwendeten Terms."@de,
      "A new requirement with a unique business code exists in the architecture model, linked to the terms used in its text."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#mainStep> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/3137c43d-db1c-487b-b929-2ecd6c7bbaef>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/53dbc1f5-f26d-40c7-bc0c-1738a828cf5c>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/d0bb1d81-b0b3-4f49-adc8-89a590f9862d>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/0ebcdade-265d-4be1-9fdc-66f41492c04c>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/f655d63d-636f-426c-99e8-7588acb62d3d>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/594309b8-be2d-4238-9a51-e34715b71a17>;
    <http://open-services.net/ns/rm#satisfies> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/943d28d3-95aa-4ee3-b6db-55add7df5dd3>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#extensionStep> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/853a593c-7999-44c4-99cb-42ce608c3b82>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#useCasePrecondition> "Requirements Engineer und Coding AI Agent stehen im Dialog."@de,
      "Requirements Engineer and Coding AI Agent are in dialogue."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#primaryRole> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/e0686e04-b422-47a9-aeca-89b5239cb150>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#supportingRole> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/4c4ba9ce-cd98-4f46-b63e-f090460d30ee> .
  
  <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/55bde8b5-1a6d-47d5-b8c4-50f435bfc207> a <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#UseCase>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "UC3";
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Requirement korrigieren"@de, "Correct a requirement"@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#useCaseGoal> "Ein bereits erfasstes Requirement gibt das inzwischen geschärfte Verständnis wieder, ohne seine Identität im Architekturmodell zu verlieren."@de,
      "An already recorded requirement reflects the understanding as it has since been sharpened, without losing its identity in the architecture model."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#trigger> "Im weiteren Dialog zeigt sich, dass ein bereits erfasstes Requirement missverständlich, unvollständig oder nicht testbar formuliert ist."@de,
      "In further dialogue it becomes apparent that an already recorded requirement is ambiguous, incomplete, or not testable as worded."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#useCasePostcondition> "Das Requirement trägt unter unverändertem Business-Code die korrigierte Fassung; seine Verknüpfungen zu Terms und Constraints bestehen fort."@de,
      "The requirement carries the corrected wording under its unchanged business code; its links to terms and constraints remain in place."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#mainStep> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/68b20975-6972-4d30-a0dc-0938e1147588>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/63f6ad8a-d440-4138-a6c0-7bc69b20ace0>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/c383b214-cc6e-43f8-938d-7ed9d8eee78e>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/a1142570-cc1f-45ef-99eb-d90c5afc9f9d>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/f34dbd5d-2b12-4eb0-ad2d-f1356910f833>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/f2cfecad-cc87-4fd7-ad37-0ae0363611bf>;
    <http://open-services.net/ns/rm#satisfies> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/2a1acada-473e-4a73-9c1f-b54b7b463445>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/80601114-b9c2-4c74-8616-a23d586fed75>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#extensionStep> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/da9f8dc8-f2a0-48fe-988a-cc0fc491a9b2>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/d2499f09-0727-4dbc-b4a3-8ce9ebfe158a>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/ed3fbb8c-ba96-4901-81ac-bf439f181236>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#useCasePrecondition> "Das betroffene Requirement existiert im Architekturmodell."@de,
      "The affected requirement exists in the architecture model."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#primaryRole> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/e0686e04-b422-47a9-aeca-89b5239cb150>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#supportingRole> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/4c4ba9ce-cd98-4f46-b63e-f090460d30ee> .
  
  <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/5277fb69-94b4-4526-a981-1a1e244b431d> a <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#UseCase>;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "UC4";
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Requirement akzeptieren"@de, "Accept a requirement"@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#useCaseGoal> "Für Mitlesende ist am Requirement erkennbar, dass es nicht mehr im Entwurf steht, sondern inhaltlich abgestimmt ist."@de,
      "Readers can tell from the requirement that it is no longer a draft but has been agreed."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#trigger> "Der Requirements Engineer hält ein erfasstes Requirement für inhaltlich ausreichend geklärt."@de,
      "The Requirements Engineer considers a recorded requirement sufficiently clarified."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#useCasePostcondition> "Das Requirement steht auf ACCEPTED; sein Text und seine Verknüpfungen sind unverändert."@de,
      "The requirement is in status ACCEPTED; its text and its links are unchanged."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#mainStep> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/efd8e07a-06fe-4614-b444-69ce90caf0a1>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/c81e99d9-73b1-4ee3-99fd-e243e88cc6cf>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/9b4a9a27-1288-40d6-b29a-8dbadbe012f0>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/3877ac00-589a-4f46-aac0-b6dd4fcf38f1>;
    <http://open-services.net/ns/rm#satisfies> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/d9de2fa4-1c52-44a0-868a-ab929db8ae65>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#extensionStep> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/d21ae2af-0fa3-4d45-8687-e1a3b8c29e97>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/ee9fb92c-d568-4c6e-b63b-4e5736b67e01>, <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/558a0a99-4221-4bda-b03f-78fa437ded4c>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#useCasePrecondition> "Das betroffene Requirement existiert im Architekturmodell."@de,
      "The requirement in question exists in the architecture model."@en;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#primaryRole> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/e0686e04-b422-47a9-aeca-89b5239cb150>;
    <https://w3id.org/arknet/requirements#supportingRole> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/4c4ba9ce-cd98-4f46-b63e-f090460d30ee> .
